@startuml Connix System Context
title Connix System Context

actor "Network / systems\ndeveloper" as developer
actor "QA / test\nengineer" as qa
actor "Visual user" as visual
actor "Library integrator" as integrator
component "Connix" as connix
component "Network / IPC peer" as peer
component "Configuration source\n(JSON/YAML or explicit format)" as config
component "Output destination\n(stdout or file)" as output

 developer --> connix : CLI commands
 qa --> connix : scripted runs
 visual --> connix : GUI actions (optional)
 integrator --> connix : connix-core API
 config --> connix : execution configuration
 connix --> peer : TCP / UDP / UDS traffic
 connix --> output : traffic and diagnostics

@enduml
